{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日瘋傳一段影片，顯示一輛小巴在柴灣一個迴旋處入口位置疑似發生故障停下。當時有修車工人鑽入車底檢查及維修車輛，車外僅露出一雙腳。不料有途經市民路過見狀，疑誤會有人不幸被捲入車底，遂引發一場救援驚魂。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m48s202.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Wc8KAzq1EG1790742758.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m48s202.png\"/></div></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">影片尾段顯示，消防車迅速接報抵達現場，多名消防員隨即上前包圍小巴了解狀況。隨後，該名修車工人及時並順利從車底爬出，證實並無受困。現場圍觀民眾見狀即時鬆一口氣，片中更傳出陣陣歡呼聲，幸好最終只是虛驚一場。 </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m57s293.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026skzbmPJ6cr1790742767.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m57s293.png\"/></div></div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m59s384.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UQ0FNf0KK41790742774.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-30-12h24m59s384.png\"/></div></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-30T05:20:29.777972+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}